1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,726
After a past reporting verb, every tense moves one step back.

2
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:06,575
I write becomes he said he wrote.

3
00:00:06,575 --> 00:00:08,854
I am writing: he was writing.

4
00:00:08,854 --> 00:00:11,067
I have written: he had written.

5
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:12,812
I wrote: he had written.

6
00:00:12,812 --> 00:00:15,195
I was writing: he had been writing.

7
00:00:15,195 --> 00:00:17,330
I will write: he would write.

8
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:22,695
And the past perfect stays as it is, because there is no further step back.

